msgid "About RocketBank — Architecture & Leadership"
msgstr "О RocketBank — Архитектура и руководство"

#: templates/about.html:5
msgid ""
"Learn about RocketBank's real-time financial architecture, executive "
"leadership, regulatory compliance, and Almaty headquarters."
